refactor(nlp): rename nlp package and extract rdf-canonize driver

Renames packages/foundation/capability/nlp to packages/foundation/capability/nlp-processing
and adds the new packages/foundation/modeling/nlp modeling package.

Extracts RDF canonicalization from packages/foundation/capability/semantic-web into the new
packages/drivers/rdf-canonize, moves the evidence, prov, and web-annotation models into
packages/foundation/modeling/rdf behind compatibility re-exports, and renames the
packages/foundation/modeling/onotology directory to ontology.
